  "releaseNotes": "- Add attribute passthrough for headless input components. Components inheriting StaticInputBase now expose an AdditionalAttributes collection holding the HTML attributes a consumer wrote that weren't bound to a C# property, which can be applied to any element in the component's template with the new static-attributes tag helper.\n\t\t- class and style merge with the values authored in the template, and the new class-replace attribute lets a consumer discard the component's classes when a merge can't express the override.",
